  "Only OpRegion 2.0 and 2.1 admitted (Linux applies 2.1 semantics to all >2.0).",
  "2.1 RVDA < OPREGION_SIZE refused (Linux WARN_ON then maps).",
  "RVDS > 64 KiB refused (vbt_size is u16).",
