  "Declared header SIZE must be >= 8 (unit not given at the pin; KiB by IGD convention).",
  "Extra refusals never redirect selection: vbt_size < sizeof(vbt_header), BDB signature prefix 'BIOS_DATA_BLOCK', zero-sum checksum. The checksum semantics are a convention, NOT stated by the pinned primary (vbt_defs.h documents vbt_checksum only as 'Checksum'; intel_bios.c does not verify it).",
  "kIOMapDefaultCache (XNU per-page policy) instead of MEMREMAP_WB.",
  "Two-pass coherence: header, RVDA/RVDS, every published byte, ASLS, GGC and BDSM re-read; any difference refuses.",
  "VBT bytes differing from an earlier capture in the same instance are refused (Changed) and unpublished.",
  "intel_no_opregion_vbt DMI quirk lists only ThinkCentre A57 (97027RG); not applicable to the pinned 17aa:3e77 profile."
 ],
